# raffpoyb-cyber-program

An offensive-security LEARNING lab. See README.md for the full guide.

Purpose: build real penetration-testing / ethical-hacking skills against
systems you own or are explicitly authorized to test — local vulnerable VMs,
and hosted practice platforms (TryHackMe, Hack The Box, PortSwigger Academy,
PicoCTF).

THIS PROJECT IS FOR EDUCATION AND AUTHORIZED TESTING ONLY. Only attack machines
you own or have written permission to test. Unauthorized scanning, access, or
exploitation of systems you do not control is illegal and is not supported here.

